* Sample-and-Hold — 180nm NMOS Switch
* W={W}um, Csamp={Csamp}, fin={fin}, fclk={fclk}
* Expected Ron ~ 400 ohm, tau = Ron*Csamp

.include {model_path}

* Input: sine wave
Vin in 0 SIN(0.9 0.8 {fin} 0 0)

* Clock: pulse (100 MHz, 25% duty)
Vclk clk 0 PULSE(0 {vdd} 0 0.1n 0.1n {ton} {tclk})

* NMOS pass transistor
M1 in clk out out NMOS W={W}u L={L}u

* Sampling capacitor
Csamp out 0 {Csamp}

* Supply for biasing
Vdd vdd 0 DC {vdd}

.tran {tstep} {tstop} UIC

.print tran v(in) v(clk) v(out)

.end
